# tracker.actors.v0
#
# Runtime owner: Loop tracker realization.
# Law realized: premath.issue-transition.v0 witness-class gate.
#
# File layout:
#   ${BOAT_TRACKER_ROOT}/actors.tsv
#
# Rows are:
#   actor<TAB>witness-class,witness-class,...
#
# The parser also accepts actor,witness-class,witness-class,... for small
# hand-authored fixtures, but the canonical spelling is tab separated.
#
# Actor:
#   identity.presentation:* reference
#
# Witness classes:
#   SubjectValid
#   CredentialValid
#   ScopeValid
#   FreshAt
#   IssuerTrusted
#   SignedBy
#
# Agent bundle:
#   SubjectValid, CredentialValid, ScopeValid, FreshAt
#
# Operator bundle:
#   IssuerTrusted, SignedBy, SubjectValid, CredentialValid, ScopeValid, FreshAt
#
# v0 checks only declared witness classes against the transition role table.
# Cryptographic witness verification and identity admission are a later rung.
